00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.3 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Your income mix and diversification

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Choose two or three priority income streams and limit any single source.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Note timing, restrictions and effort for each source.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Set a maximum share for any one funder.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Plan how the mix should change over three years.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara: Foundation A (50%) ends next year. Priorities: a new foundation, a larger camp sponsor, monthly giving. No funder above 40%.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your priority income sources and mix rules.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
